page('privacy','Privacy notice','How enquiries are handled on the SIT Technology website.',intro('YOUR INFORMATION','Privacy, made clear.','A working privacy notice for this initial website release.')+'''<article class="article-body wrap"><section><h2>About this preview</h2><p>The private design preview does not send or store project enquiries. Please use sample information while exploring the form.</p></section><section><h2>When the WordPress site is configured</h2><p>The request form collects your name, work email, organisation, challenge description, request type, service interest, indicative budget, timeline and your consent to respond. Depending on your request, it also collects your preferred conversation format, time zone and availability; project stage and product type; or required roles, team size and engagement duration. Authorised SIT request staff use this information to review and respond to your request.</p><p>The form is for general business enquiries. Do not include sensitive personal information, credentials or confidential project material. No marketing subscription is created when you submit an enquiry.</p></section><section><h2>Before public launch</h2><p>SIT Technology must publish its verified contact details, applicable legal basis, retention period, processors, international transfer arrangements and rights contact before enabling live enquiries. The website administrator controls whether enquiries are enabled.</p></section><section><h2>Cookies</h2><p>This theme does not add advertising or analytics cookies. WordPress and hosting services may use necessary cookies. Any additional tracking requires a reviewed notice and appropriate controls.</p></section></article>''')
page('accessibility','Accessibility','SIT Technology’s approach to an accessible website.',intro('ACCESSIBILITY','Designed for<br><em>more people.</em>','We aim to make this website clear, readable and usable across devices and input methods.')+'''<article class="article-body wrap"><section><h2>Included in this release</h2><p>Keyboard-operable navigation, visible focus indicators, labelled forms, a skip link, reduced-motion support and responsive layouts are built into the theme.</p></section><section><h2>Ongoing improvement</h2><p>This is an initial implementation. A full accessibility evaluation with assistive technologies is required before making a formal conformance claim. If something gets in your way, describe the page and the problem through the project enquiry form once live enquiries are enabled.</p></section></article>''')
